		(uuid "4ef434d9-ab96-4fc7-b1e3-d70a8752f402")
	)
	(text "Ref: TI SLVSH93A sec. 6.4 (recommended capacitance), 8.4.1 (ADCIN straps), Fig. 9-26 (application).\nADCIN1 = LDO_3V3 (decoded 7), ADCIN2 = GND (0) -> SafeMode dead-battery behaviour, I2C target index #1 = 0x20.\nPatch + configuration load from the EEPROM at 0x50 on I2Cc. Source role disabled in the configuration (sink only)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 30.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "36a25216-8dc9-465e-9898-88bb047473f6")
	)
	(text "PD configuration EEPROM (64 KB, 0x50) + programming pads"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 269.24 25.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.5 2.5)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "1ef46dea-cf2f-4ffa-a412-5fbd47ceb314")
	)
	(text "TPS25751 needs >= 36 KB at 7-bit 0x50 on I2Cc. WC high = write-protected; pull EE_WP low at the pad to program.\nProgram with the board on battery (TPS25751 waits for a host when the EEPROM is blank)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 269.24 30.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "1ffe0988-c93e-40b1-8ce3-cdec6504ae00")
	)
	(text "NVDC buck-boost charger (BQ25713) - power stage"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 425.45 25.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.5 2.5)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d6803cb4-e358-4e7a-b71d-e144ed92cfb0")
	)
	(text "Ref: TI SLUSD83C Fig. 10-1 / 10-2. RAC = RSR = 10 mOhm. fsw default 800 kHz. Q1..Q4 CSD17577Q3A (30 V, 6.4 mOhm @4.5 V),\nL = 2.2 uH Isat 14 A. BATFET CSD25404Q3 (-20 V, 5.5 mOhm @ -4.5 V, Ciss 1.63 nF < 5 nF limit). Battery path sized for 12 A (decision Q3/Q4)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 425.45 30.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "706b8cb9-da34-460e-9ceb-e9db0143f025")
	)
	(text "NVDC charger (BQ25713) - controller"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 140.97 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.5 2.5)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "807469a6-3f69-4359-91c9-3dbe9a04afd6")
	)
	(text "I2C 0x6B on I2Cc, configured by the TPS25751 (charge 2.5 A / 4.2 V set in the PD configuration).\nILIM_HIZ 383k/220k from VDDA = 2.19 V -> 2.97 A hardware input limit. CELL_BATPRESZ 300k/100k = 25 % of VDDA -> 1S.\nCOMP/IADPT/IBAT/PSYS values from Fig. 10-1 (IADPT 137k = 2.2 uH)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 146.05 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "8270cb87-fee4-44f8-8e8b-9e9c71be94c8")
	)
	(text "Battery connector (1S, 5000 mAh, PCM >= 12 A) and fuel gauge (MAX17055)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 391.16 140.97 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.5 2.5)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "30ec5ef7-fe08-4b80-a60a-ed3964ca54ad")
	)
	(text "Molex 505578-0971 (right angle): pins 1-4 BAT+, 5-8 BAT-, 9 NTC (4 x 3.0 A per side = 12 A). Pack PCM >= 12 A (decision Q4).\nMAX17055: low-side sense 4 mOhm (+-51.2 mV / 4 mOhm = +-12.8 A); CSP = IC ground (battery side), CSN Kelvin to load side.\nInternal temperature mode (AIN tied to CSP, THRM open) - the pack NTC drives the charge cutoff comparator."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 391.16 146.05 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "8c583d7d-3c70-46a5-bce7-774567a199cd")
	)
	(text "Battery temperature charge window 0-45 C (pack NTC 10 kOhm B3435, battery spec C2-1)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 222.25 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.5 2.5)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0fa0d468-ae43-483d-b94f-89e9f13c403f")
	)
	(text "Only active while an adapter is present (CHRG_OK high switches VNTC on and enables Q_a), so a hot/cold battery\ncan still power the system. Out of window -> CELL_BATPRESZ pulled low -> BQ25713 disables charging.\nThresholds (ratiometric, VNTC): cold 0.738*VNTC (~0 C, 28.7k), hot 0.320*VNTC (~46 C, 4.7k). Missing NTC reads as cold -> no charging."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 227.33 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "406b1931-b572-4db4-aa4e-af38e7c9f2cb")
	)
	(text "Always-on 3.3 V (from VSYS)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 264.16 222.25 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.5 2.5)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9bb95e94-c56c-4657-9d92-93fb30d7a253")
	)
	(text "XC6206: Iq 1 uA, 200 mA, Vin max 6 V (VSYS <= 4.5 V). Loads: TPS25751 VIN_3V3, RTC, NTC window."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 264.16 227.33 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a0852421-b65e-4a32-a8df-9df294bcc922")
	)
